      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "One work around, that pretty much works the same as vrc_label did, is to just put an udon behavior on anything with a string variable. in any script that would use tags, just have it check for this string!",
